{"id":"627346","name":"小米黑面馒头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/627346/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小米洗净。","img":"images/627346/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放锅里煮开。","img":"images/627346/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒豆浆杯中。","img":"images/627346/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"选果蔬。","img":"images/627346/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打成米糊。","img":"images/627346/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒容器内。","img":"images/627346/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放至温热，放酵母搅拌均匀。","img":"images/627346/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放黑面。","img":"images/627346/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/627346/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/627346/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取出来揉光排气。","img":"images/627346/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"做成馒头。","img":"images/627346/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放烤箱低温二次发酵。","img":"images/627346/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"发好的馒头。","img":"images/627346/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"入蒸锅，大火烧开，改中火蒸25分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/627346/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627346/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"我吃着这么做的馒头有点甜，跟放了白糖差不多，建议血糖高的人群不吃这个。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：破壁机、蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}